  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LEBANON- PUBLIC ADMINISTRATION REFORM &amp; DIGITALIZATION PROJECT (L-PARD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L-PARDP is positioned to re-activate core government functions and public services, and support key decision-making and reform processes while transforming Lebanons Public Sector into a digitally integrated, paperless, efficient, and user-centric future, by linking conventional public administration and civil service reforms with targeted digitalization investments; which builds on the ongoing digital identify process. The program is designed across two phases, with Phase 1 (12 months) focus on</narrative>
  </description>
